<title>POLAND: ROLIMPEX OCT NET RISES TO PLN 9.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>ROLIMPEX OCT NET RISES TO PLN 9.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.98 vs    0.96</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.98 vs    1.43</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.13 vs    4.06</p>
<p> Sales		  153.87 vs  103.89</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    21.57 vs   32.61</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	34.98 vs   52.40</p>
<p> Operating profit    65.13 vs   64.20</p>
<p> Sales		1,092.93 vs  884.81</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food trader is Rolimpex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
